title: FamA
when: $day == 1 && $package == "backpack" && $damage == 0
position: -1426,-631
color: purple
group: FamA
group: Day1
---
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
<<once>>
Mailman: Morning! Are you Lina?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SpeakingTired">>
Lina: That’s me! Sofie, your package is here!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "ListeningTired">>
Mailman: Wonderful! I just need your signature here.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SpeakingTired">>
Lina: Of course. Are you new around here? I haven’t seen you before.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Yeah, just started, actually. Still getting the hang of it. You’ll have to be patient with this old man, hahaha.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh, so you are just like Sofie! She just started in a new school.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: Are you nervous?
    <<jump engage1>>
-> Mailman: Oh yeah? Well, enjoy your package!
    <<jump end1>>
<<else>>
...
<<endonce>>
===

