title: FamA
when: $day == 2 && $package == "uniform" && $damage == 0
//undamaged package
color: purple
group: FamA
group: Day2
position: -921,-631
---
<<once>>
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
Mailman: Good Morning Lina! More school supplies I'm guessing.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: [Sign]Yes, you got me[/Sign]. I got Sofie the new uniform.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Hello Mr.Mailman...
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Hello Sofie, are you excited about your new uniform?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: No, I wanted new cool clothes, but my mom won't let me.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: You know that's not true we can barely afford the uniform, I'm not gonna waste money when you have clothes that still fit you. #emotion:tired,sad
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Well that is unfair, uniforms are stupid. #emotion:annoyed
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: Ouch, I don't think my uniform is stupid. #enotion:nice
    <<set $relationshipFamA += 1>>
    <<jump engage2>>
-> Mailman: You should listen to your mother. #emotion:annoyed
    <<set $relationshipFamA -= 0.5>>
    <<jump bad1>>
-> Mailman: I might have another package for you. <<if $clothes == true>> 
    <<set $relationshipFamA += 3>>
    <<jump engage3>>
<<else>>
<<setBackground "BGFamA">>
...
<<hideBackground>>
<<endonce>>
===

title: engage2
color: green
group: FamA
position: -922,-426
---
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: I didn't mean to say that, I just would like some new clothes. #emotion:sad
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Yeah, I get it. Just don't be so hard on your mom, she's trying her best.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: I promise that we'll go shopping next month. Thank you, Mr.Mailman.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Have a great day.
<<hideCharacter "Lina">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

title: bad1
color: red
group: FamA
position: -701,-426
---
