title: engage3
color: green
group: FamA
position: -922,-426
---
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: I don't think I ordered anything else
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: This one is addressed to Sofie.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: To me...?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Yeah, it's from Vera, your Neighbour.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Vera? I don't think I know her.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: She has the cutest little boy, that's probably why you haven't seen her much. That boy is a piece of work.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh that's just perfect, we've been looking for something Sofie could do after school. What do you think Sofie?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Oh yeah, it would be awesome and I can also thank her for the package. I'll you write her a note, could you give it to her Mr.Mailman?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
Mailman: Of course! I'm sure she we'll be excited to have an evening to relax and have a night out with her husband.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
<<declare $noteForVera = true>>
Sofie: Here you have the note, I wrote my number in case she wants to contact with me.
<<hideCharacter "Lina">>
<<hideBackground>>
===

title: FamA
when: $day == 2 && $package == "uniform" && $damage == 1 && $packageState == "damaged"
//1st time damaged
color: purple
group: FamA
group: Day2
position: -921,-631
---
<<setBackgroung "BGFamA">>
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mail man: Morning Lina!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Sofie, come here!
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mail man: Wonderful! I just need your signature here.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Oh but this package is damaged, what happened to it?
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaListeningTired">>
Mailman: I’m so sorry, it was a bumpy ride.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSpeakingTired">>
Lina: Anyways, I’m glad it at least arrived.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: It’s that my new uniform? 
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: That’s right, how was your first day?
<<jump engage5>>
-> Mailman: Yes, I hope you enjoy it.
	Sofie: Thank you Mr.Mailman.
	Lina: Bye Mr.Mailman.
	Mailman: Have a nice day.
===
title: FamA
when: $day == 2 && $package == "uniform" && $damage == 2 && $packageState == "damaged"
//damaged AGAIN 
color: purple
group: FamA
group: Day2
position: -921,-631
---
Mail man: Morning Lina!
Lina: Sofie, come here!
Mail man: Wonderful! I just need your signature here.
Lina: Oh but this package is damaged again, I thought you said it wasn’t going to happen again.
Mailman: I’m so sorry, it was a bumpy ride.
Lina: Anyways, I’m glad it at least arrived.
Sofie: It’s that my new uniform? 
-> Mailman: That’s right, how was your first day?
<<jump engage5>>
-> Mailman: Yes, I hope you enjoy it.
	Sofie: Thank you Mr.Mailman.
	Lina: Bye Mr.Mailman.
	Mailman: Have a nice day.
===

title: engage5
---
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Some kids already called me weird yesterday because I didn’t have my uniform and my clothes were old.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "LinaSSpeakingTired">>
Lina: We are working on it, I promised her we will go shopping next month. 
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieSpeakingTired">>
Sofie: Yeah, but until then I will avoid any chances of meeting my classmates out of school.
<<showCharacter "Lina" "SofieListeningTired">>
-> Mailman: I might have something to fix that, just wait here while I look in my truck.
-> Mailman: Wow, that’s a lot of free time
